<Base title="How to assess a UAE property before you buy · The Compass Key Method" description="Every recommendation goes through the same five checks: price, returns, risk, exit, and my view.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Investment approach</p>
      <h1>The Compass Key <em>Method</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Clarity before commitment. Before you put capital into a UAE property, you should see the numbers, and hear an honest view on whether the deal deserves your money.</p>
      <p>I work for you — not a developer, not a sales target. If a listing isn't right for you, I'll say so, even if it costs me the deal. Every recommendation goes through the same five checks, not a headline stat.</p>

      <h2>The five checks</h2>
      <ol style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <li><strong>Price.</strong> What comparable units actually sold for, per Dubai Land Department records, not the asking price.</li>
        <li><strong>Returns.</strong> Net yield after service charges, vacancy and management. For off-plan, the payment plan set against your cash flow.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk.</strong> The developer's delivery record, the project's escrow status, and the supply arriving in the same area.</li>
        <li><strong>Exit.</strong> Who buys this unit from you in five years, and at what realistic price.</li>
        <li><strong>My view:</strong> buy, watch, or pass. If the numbers don't work, I'll tell you not to buy.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>How a Compass Key Brief is built</h2>
      <p>Send me any UAE property, by link or name. I run it through the five checks using sourced, dated figures and send you a short brief with the numbers and my recommendation. There is no obligation.</p>

      <h2>Why this approach</h2>
      <p>In UAE real estate since 2018, with a decade of experience across banking sales and senior management behind me, I read the cash flow before the brochure. That is the discipline behind every brief.</p>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:2rem">
        <h3 style="color:var(--navy)">The Compass Key Brief</h3>
        <p class="small">Send me any UAE property and I'll run the numbers: price, returns, risk, exit, my view. You can also run your own numbers on the <a href="/invest">ROI Calculator</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="actions"><a href="/contact" class="btn">Get the numbers on a property</a></div>

      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:2rem">Figures are sourced and dated. This is property analysis, not financial advice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
